{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your speed is your power. Leap, dash, and slash your way to victory in this 2D Speedrunner platformer that blends the lightning speed of Sonic, the striking style of Metroid, and the intense combat of Mega Man. As Kin, you'll equip a cutting-edge suit and race to save your world from a mysterious alien invasion. <br> <br>In the all-new <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>, you'll strategically unlock new powers the faster you go, turning a desperate sprint into a showcase of skill and speed. The desperate sprint is only the beginning of your journey to break your limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/extras/064dca738bb7115ba93d53ab273b3490.poster.avif?t=1759137724\" width=700 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/extras/064dca738bb7115ba93d53ab273b3490.webm?t=1759137724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, dash, and slash through intricate environments with pixel-perfect precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/extras/c0bf9a10dc125adfe41695a6c00d7a4f.poster.avif?t=1759137724\" width=700 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/extras/c0bf9a10dc125adfe41695a6c00d7a4f.webm?t=1759137724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a dynamic arsenal of abilities that change how you approach every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/extras/8e2639664374a42be7b6abb7bc970ba0.poster.avif?t=1759137724\" width=700 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/extras/8e2639664374a42be7b6abb7bc970ba0.webm?t=1759137724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks and compete against the world's best in Trials Mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Word from the Developers</strong><br>Kinetic: Break All Limits is the culmination of years of passionate dedication from our small team of three developers. We've poured our hearts and souls into building this game, even crafting a custom engine in C++ from the ground up to achieve the precise responsiveness and visual style we envisioned for Kinetic's high-speed gameplay. With a world of possibilities at your fingertips and the power to choose your path, it's up to you to break your limits and become the hero your planet needs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1987710?t=1759137724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/0fe96bc4b234a24883ecf8eabcf8254bc36dc171/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759137724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/bccfbb9bf85