s game, even crafting a custom engine in C++ from the ground up to achieve the precise responsiveness and visual style we envisioned for Kinetic's high-speed gameplay. With a world of possibilities at your fingertips and the power to choose your path, it's up to you to break your limits and become the hero your planet needs.</p>","developers":["Break All Limits LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987710/8074e7b0975f2e9a562c8f7217ac38dec070152f/header.jpg?t=1759137724","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1987710/664821/a0e5e01344d8774be47658b50da1ee48f9d94560/1751064528/dash_av1.mpd?t=1708470347","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1987710/664821/a0e5e01344d8774be47658b50da1ee48f9d94560/1751064528/dash_h264.mpd?t=1708470347","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1987710/664821/a0e5e01344d8774be47658b50da1ee48f9d94560/1751064528/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1708470347","id":257002361,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002361/movie480.mp4?t=1708470347","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002361/movie_max.mp4?t=1708470347"},"name":"Early Access Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257002361/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1708470347","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002361/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1708470347","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002361/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1708470347"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1987710/633366/34d5905cfaca732a3dc981ee63305d871c9bf8f